From: PixOS-Project contributors
Subject: [PATCH 0006] panfrost/sweet: libsweetgl target (iOS GLES frontend, libdrm stand-in, EAGL shim, selftest) and IOSurface import

PixOS G3 (docs/research/52 "G3 result"). On top of 0001-0005.
- sweet transport: optional import_surface (SweetMali selector 5) and bo_cache_sync (selector 6); iokit implements both.
- sweet kmod: IOSurface imports are parked by sweet_kmod_import_surface() and taken by bo_import; pan_kmod_bo_import
  takes the size of such a handle from the parked import instead of lseek() on a dma-buf.
- src/gallium/targets/sweetgl: libsweetgl.dylib (frontend modelled on frontends/hgl, sweet_drm.c, GLI wrappers generated
  from dispatch.h, EAGL shim) and sweetgl_selftest; built when -Ddarwin-sweet=true on Darwin with panfrost.

